          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Volume total : %lld reps": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Total volume: %lld reps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vos données n’ont pas pu être ouvertes au lancement : aucune sauvegarde n’est écrite tant que l’application fonctionne sur une base temporaire.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your data could not be opened at launch: no backup is written while the app runs on a temporary database."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vos données restent utilisables hors ligne en permanence. La synchronisation ne fait que les recopier entre vos appareils.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your data stays usable offline at all times. Syncing only copies it between your devices."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vos exercices personnalisés ne recoupent ni le catalogue ni un autre exercice personnalisé.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your custom exercises overlap neither the catalog nor another custom exercise."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vos records de 1RM et de répétitions apparaîtront ici au fil des séances.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your 1RM and repetition records will appear here as you train."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vos séances terminées apparaîtront ici.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your finished workouts will appear here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Votre clé reste dans le Trousseau de cet appareil : elle n’est ni exportée, ni synchronisée, ni écrite dans les journaux. Muscu n’embarque aucune clé.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your key stays in the Keychain of this device: it is neither exported, nor synced, nor written to the journals. Muscu ships no key of its own."
          }
        }
      }
    },
